  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National child labour policy and effective measures for its implementation are developed</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO is assisting the Family Affairs Council to conduct a National Child Labour Survey (CLS). This effort will combine direct technical assistance in the design, implementation and reporting phases of the CLS with knowledge transfer and capacity-building activities aimed at helping the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development (MHRSD), the Family Affair Council (FAC) and the General Authority for Statistics (GASTAT) develop a better understanding of child labour indicators and the best practices in surveying this phenomenon.</narrative>
  </description>
